Third-party material
--------------------

The evaluation records under evals/ quote short excerpts from published
benchmark datasets, and text that evaluated agents wrote from them: example
questions in evals/external/results/summary.md, and card lines and values in
the reports and audit worksheets under evals/agent/results/. That material is
not covered by the Apache License. It remains under the licence of the dataset
it comes from:

  MEME               CC BY 4.0      https://huggingface.co/datasets/meme-benchmark/MEME
  LoCoMo             CC BY-NC 4.0   https://github.com/snap-research/locomo
  LongMemEval        MIT            https://huggingface.co/datasets/xiaowu0162/longmemeval-cleaned
  MemoryAgentBench   MIT            https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai-hyz/MemoryAgentBench

The datasets themselves are not redistributed. evals/external/sources.py pins
the revision, digest and licence of each file the evaluations download.
